@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title E03：running 在 tick 之间记住 START
binary "start" as S
binary "stop" as P
binary "running（前一）" as R
binary "running' = pump" as N
@1
S is low
P is low
R is low
N is low
@2
S is high
N is high
@3
S is low
R is high
@4
S is high
P is high
N is low
@5
S is low
P is low
R is low
@6
highlight 2 to 3 : 自锁开始
highlight 4 to 5 : 停止优先
@enduml
